  aciklama: "6. kat, daire 3 ve 4 birlikte (\xE7ift daire, s\u0131ralama / yerle\u015Ftirme).
    Sofrada d\xF6rt isim kart\u0131; d\xF6rt tabak iki daireye da\u011F\u0131lm\u0131\u015F.
    Alt\u0131 kilit: 4'\xFCn kileri (\u015Fifre 3'\xFCn takviminde), 3'\xFCn mutfa\u011F\u0131
    (anahtar 4'\xFCn buzdolab\u0131nda), 3'\xFCn yatak odas\u0131 (k\u0131r\u0131k
    anahtar, iki dairede), 4'\xFCn banyosu (mente\u015Fe), 4'\xFCn yatak odas\u0131
    (3'\xFCn kilerindeki kol), b\xFCfe (sofra)."
